{"ticker":"ADI","updated":"2026-11-20T22:34:32Z","profile":{"longName":"Analog Devices, Inc.","shortName":"Analog Devices, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"United States","website":"https://www.analog.com","fullTimeEmployees":24500,"marketCap":167620886528,"trailingPE":41.083138,"forwardPE":20.986444,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":12.074915,"pegRatio":0.56,"targetMeanPrice":474.46875,"targetHighPrice":675.0,"targetLowPrice":365.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":32,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.396,"earningsGrowth":1.635,"grossMargins":0.65800005,"operatingMargins":0.35671002,"profitMargins":0.29787,"totalRevenue":13881744384,"beta":1.256,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":445.91,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":225.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.17},"summary":"Analog Devices, Inc. engages in the design, manufacture, testing, and marketing of integrated circuits (ICs), software, and subsystems products in the United States, rest of North and South America, Europe, Japan, China, and rest of Asia. It provides data converter products, which translate real-world analog signals into digital data, as well as translates digital data into analog signals; power management and reference products for power conversion, driver monitoring, sequencing, and energy management applications in the automotive, communications, industrial, and consumer markets; and power ICs that include performance, integration, and software design simulation tools for accurate power supply designs. The company also offers amplifiers to condition analog signals; and radio frequency and microwave ICs to support cellular infrastructure; and micro-electro-mechanical systems technology solutions, including accelerometers used to sense acceleration, gyroscopes for sense rotation, inertial measurement units to sense multiple degrees of freedom, and broadband switches for radio and instrument systems, as well as isolators. In addition, it provides digital signal processing and system products for numeric calculations. The company serves clients in the industrial, automotive, consumer, instrumentation, aerospace, defense and healthcare, and communications markets through a direct","summary_zh":"Analog Devices, Inc. 在美國、北美和南美其他地區、歐洲、日本、中國和亞洲其他地區從事積體電路 (IC)、軟體和子系統產品的設計、製造、測試和行銷。它提供數據轉換器產品，將現實世界的類比訊號轉換為數位數據，以及將數位數據轉換為類比訊號；用於汽車、通訊、工業和消費市場中電源轉換、驅動器監控、排序和能源管理應用的電源管理和參考產品；和電源 IC，包括用於精確電源設計的性能、整合和軟體設計模擬工具。該公司還提供調節類比訊號的放大器； and radio frequency and microwave ICs to support cellular infrastructure;和微機電系統技術解決方案，包括用於感測加速度的加速度計、用於感測旋轉的陀螺儀、用於感測多自由度的慣性測量單元、用於無線電和儀器系統的寬頻開關以及隔離器。此外，它还提供用于数值计算的数字信号处理和系统产品。該公司透過直接服務為工業、汽車、消費品、儀器儀表、航空航太、國防和醫療保健以及通訊市場的客戶提供服務。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":245.61,"h":249.04,"l":245.58,"c":247.34,"v":2167300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":248.37,"h":250.36,"l":246.33,"c":246.78,"v":2085700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":247.05,"h":249.82,"l":246.7,"c":248.61,"v":2479000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":247.57,"h":248.33,"l":243.52,"c":247.53,"v":2410900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":248.71,"h":249.41,"l":245.76,"c":247.56,"v":2648500},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":249.33,"h":249.5,"l":243.85,"c":244.79,"v":3296300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":245.81,"h":247.2,"l":243.07,"c":245.7,"v":2507800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":243.71,"h":245.59,"l":236.22,"c":239.28,"v":4916300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":242.13,"h":243.97,"l":240.44,"c":241.67,"v":2774100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":242.05,"h":246.2,"l":241.59,"c":241.99,"v":2118500},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":245.01,"h":245.01,"l":238.92,"c":242.5,"v":4021200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":243.39,"h":243.39,"l":233.03,"c":233.75,"v":3397800},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":233.8,"h":239.36,"l":233.8,"c":237.93,"v":4017900},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":236.84,"h":238.39,"l":235.1,"c":237.88,"v":3069200},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":237.74,"h":239.04,"l":224.71,"c":225.32,"v":4425100},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":228.32,"h":235.82,"l":226.96,"c":234.67,"v":4609900},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":231.15,"h":238.78,"l":229.13,"c":235.